<title>FRANCE: Templeton holds 9.2 pct of Pechiney.</title>
<headline>Templeton holds 9.2 pct of Pechiney.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. investment fund Templeton Global Investors holds 9.14 percent of the capital of French aluminium company Pechiney and 9.24 percent of the voting rights, the French stockmarkets association SBF said on Friday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that Templeton had disclosed its position after reducing its Pechiney stake to below 10 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
